WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:04,710
Oh my God, what kind of car is this?

2
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:08,310
It’s 10,000 times more handsome than the village chief’s son’s 100,000 yuan car

3
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:11,110
Sister-in-law of the He family, look, Zhang Cong is back again

4
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:14,310
Last time I took a helicopter ride, this time I drove a legendary supercar.

5
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:16,710
How much is this car worth?

6
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:21,910
Fairy, this girl is a hundred times more beautiful and noble than the stars on TV.

7
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:25,850
How is that possible? How much money did Ke Ke make in the city?

8
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,650
Boss, is this where you grew up?

9
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,450
Yes, this is the old house

10
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:34,450
Zhao Qian, write it down and immediately dispatch a top professional construction team tomorrow.

11
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:36,150
Good boss, how do you arrange it specifically?

12
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:39,350
Completely bulldoze these old mud houses according to the standards of Tianlan One

13
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:42,750
Build a modern luxury manor villa on the original site. All work and materials will be contracted.

14
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:44,350
You are responsible for coordinating the review.

15
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:47,350
Understand, the design drawings will be delivered to you within three days

16
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:51,450
It's getting late today. We won't lose it. We'll stay in the old house tonight.
